==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|стоꙗти}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*stojati||to stand}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*steh₂-|*stoh₂-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|стоя́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-стоять.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|стоя́ть|impf|pf=постоя́ть|vn=стоя́ние<q:nomen actionis>,стоя́нка<q:nomen actionis instantiae; nomen loci>,сто́йло<q:nomen loci et instrumenti>,сто́йбище<q:nomen loci>|vadj=стоя́чий,стоя́лый|vadv=стоймя́}}

# to [[stand]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ваза|Ва́за]] '''стои́т''' [[на]] [[столе́]].|t=The vase '''is standing''' on the table.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[человек|Челове́к]] '''стои́т''' [[посреди́]] [[ко́мнаты]].|t=The person '''is standing''' in the middle of the room.}}
# to be [[situated]] ({{non-gloss|usually about a [[towering]] or potentially towering object}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[Пари́ж]] '''стои́т''' [[на]] [[Сена|Се́не]].|t=Paris '''stands''' on the Seine.}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to be in a [[certain]] [[place]] within a [[formal]] [[structure]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[У]] [[вла́сти]] '''стои́т''' [[преступный|престу́пная]] [[кли́ка]].|t=Within the government '''stands''' a criminal clique.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[этот|Э́тот]] [[челове́к]] '''стои́т''' [[в]] [[организационный|организа́ционной]] [[иера́рхии]] [[вы́ше]] [[всех]].|t=This person '''stands''' above everyone in the organisational hierarchy.}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to [[firmly]] [[follow]] or [[adhere]] {{+obj|ru|:на(pre)<to something>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[упо́рно]] '''стоя́л''' [[на]] [[своём]].|t=He stubbornly '''held''' his ground.|lit=He stubbornly '''stood''' on his own [story, argument].}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы|Мы]] '''стои́м''' [[на]] [[при́нципе]] [[ра́венства]].|t=We '''stand''' on the principle of equality.}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to be [[idle]], to be in a [[state]] of [[malfunction]] or [[downtime]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[машины|Маши́ны]] '''стоя́т'''.|t=The machines '''are at a standstill'''.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[часы|Часы́]] '''стоя́т'''.|t=The clock '''is stuck'''.}}
#* {{quote-song|ru|year=2017|author={{w|lang=ru|Буерак (группа)|Буерак}}<t:{{w|Buerak}}>|title=ru:Усталость от безделья|album=Скромные Апартаменты|text=Вре́мени свобо́дного мно́го.<br>Заво́ды '''стоя́т''' — совсе́м не беда́.|t=|url=https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=qzvcM2d1M8k}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to [[withstand]], to [[survive]], to not [[succumb]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[В]] [[э́том]] [[бою́]] [[они́]] '''стоя́ли''' [[на́смерть]].|t=In this battle, they '''withstood''' to the death.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to be [[in line]], to be in a [[queue]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''стоя́л''' [[за]] [[хле́бом]] [[с]] [[двух]] [[часо́в]].|t=I've '''been standing''' [in line] for bread since two o'clock.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[он|Он]] '''стои́т''' [[в]] [[о́череди]] [[на]] [[опера́цию]] [[тре́тьим]], [[сра́зу]] [[за]] [[свои́м]] [[сосе́дом]] [[по]] [[пала́те]].|t=He '''stands''' third in line for surgery, immediately behind his wardmate.}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to be [[frozen]]
# {{lb|ru|in the imperative}} expresses a demand to [[stop]] or stop [[moving]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Стой''', [[ты]] [[же]] [[навреди́шь]] [[себе́]].|t='''Wait''', you're going to hurt yourself.}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to be [[erect]]

====Usage notes====
* Not to be confused with most of the conjugation forms pertaining to {{m|ru|сто́ить}}. Note the difference in stress between forms of the same spelling.

